      "content": "I hear how deeply painful that feeling of being an unscripted character is, and it makes complete sense that it would be so exhausting. Please know that many people feel a similar disconnect between the \"norm\" they see and the self they know, and you don't have to accept that your struggle or your lack of \"fit\" is a permanent reality. It might help to take a slow, quiet break from trying to earn belonging in specific spaces and focus instead on re-kindling a genuine connection with yourself.",
