      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the exhaustion you feel even in your own silence and validate that the feeling of being a \"glitch\" is incredibly heavy and isolating. It is okay to acknowledge that despair sometimes makes you feel like there is no point at all, and that hope can feel like a dangerous lie when it doesn't match your current pain. You deserve support to help you feel safe and seen without the pressure to \"fix\" yourself or the world, even in the hurting moments.",
